    "From the `describe()` results, useful insights include the average values, spread of the data, minimum and maximum values, and quartiles for numeric columns. These help identify the typical range and possible outliers. Less useful summaries are statistics for columns where the numeric values are really just IDs, because averages of IDs usually do not have meaningful interpretation.\n"
   ]
  },
